WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.389 --> 00:00:02.007
(buzzing)

00:00:05.223 --> 00:00:06.662
- Nick what'd you do that for?

00:00:06.662 --> 00:00:07.357
- Do what?

00:00:08.687 --> 00:00:09.940
- You killed the mozzy.

00:00:11.174 --> 00:00:12.500
- Yeah?

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.034
- Dude that thing probably
has a family, you know?

00:00:18.519 --> 00:00:19.567
- Where you going?

00:00:19.567 --> 00:00:20.798
- [Voiceover] I'm burying it!

00:00:27.379 --> 00:00:29.255
- Hey, Ten, can you do me a huge favor,

00:00:29.255 --> 00:00:30.649
and cover my Sunday shift?

00:00:30.649 --> 00:00:32.156
I've just got a thing on.

00:00:32.156 --> 00:00:34.620
- Oh, it's kind of my friends wedding.

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:36.569
- It just would mean a whole lot to me,

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:38.612
it'd be a huge favor, I'd owe you one.

00:00:38.612 --> 00:00:39.796
- Okay, sure.

00:00:39.796 --> 00:00:42.489
- Oh, awesome, you are the best, thanks.

00:00:42.489 --> 00:00:44.318
- No worries.

00:00:48.272 --> 00:00:50.340
- Hey, Nick, what are you doing?

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:51.524
- I got a date tonight,

00:00:51.524 --> 00:00:53.079
I'm gonna try something new with my hair.

00:00:53.079 --> 00:00:54.863
How's it looking so far?

00:00:54.863 --> 00:00:55.594
- It looks great.

00:00:55.594 --> 00:00:58.058
- Yeah? Sweet, thanks man.

00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:04.438
- Hey Jemima, happy birthday!

00:01:05.487 --> 00:01:07.576
- Ten it was my birthday last week.

00:01:07.576 --> 00:01:08.924
You didn't get me anything.

00:01:08.924 --> 00:01:10.504
- I got you this.

00:01:10.504 --> 00:01:11.154
- Oh.

00:01:12.484 --> 00:01:13.948
- Here you go.

00:01:13.948 --> 00:01:14.463
- Cool.

00:01:14.463 --> 00:01:18.479
- And, surprise.

00:01:18.479 --> 00:01:19.681
- Aw.

00:01:23.235 --> 00:01:25.423
- Hey Eli, nice shirt.

00:01:25.423 --> 00:01:26.631
- What's that supposed to mean?

00:01:26.631 --> 00:01:30.364
- No, I'm being serious, I
actually like your shirt.

00:01:32.534 --> 00:01:33.204
- Alright.

00:01:38.236 --> 00:01:40.086
What's wrong with the world today?

00:01:51.236 --> 00:01:53.255
- Kay so this is Lane, that's Allen,

00:01:53.255 --> 00:01:57.807
Moxy, Rob, and uhm, Elly?

00:01:57.807 --> 00:01:58.967
- It's Eli.

00:01:58.967 --> 00:02:00.894
- Oh, Eli, sorry mate.

00:02:09.377 --> 00:02:10.862
- No one understands.

00:02:12.376 --> 00:02:13.426
- I do.

00:02:15.196 --> 00:02:16.502
It's gonna be okay.

